      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "信じてついてこーい！そして、後ろから優しくぐいぐい押してくれーーーー！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "相信我，跟上吧！然后，请从背后温柔地把我使劲往前推ーーーー！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Believe in me and follow along! And push me gently from behind, with all your might!!!!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "カメラロールみてエモくなっていた鹿乃でした。またね！！！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "翻着相册看得心潮澎湃的鹿乃。下次见！！！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This was Kano, getting emotional looking at her camera roll. See you!!!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
